    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Alice | \u611b\u8389\u6f84&quot;  is a survival horror set in a Japanese construction site.</strong><br><strong>Aim to escape from the construction site while escaping from the urban legendary woman.</strong><br><br><strong>&quot;The full version of &quot;Alice | \u611b\u8389\u6f84&quot; is now available on Steam !!&quot;</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Additional elements</strong></h2><strong>Increased volume from &quot;Alice | \u611b\u8389\u6f84\u3010DEMO\u3011&quot;.<br>Addition of save function and adjustment around UI make it easier to play.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Synopsis</strong></h2><br><strong>--2015, Tokyo.<br><br>There, an urban legend was prevalent about a woman.<br><br>Rumors of a ghost of a mistress called &quot;Alice&quot;.<br><br>Everyone was on the topic, but I didn't mind.<br><br>That day was late at the university club drinking party,<br><br>I couldn't make it in time for the last train, so I had no choice but to go home on foot.<br><br>On my way home, when I came near a pitch-black construction site, I decided to take a shortcut,<br><br>I decided to go through the camera I had just in one hand.<br><br>However, there I came across something that didn't seem to belong to this world...</strong>",
